/**
 * Tool-name and status constants for pi-claude-conversion.
 *
 * CC (Claude Code CLI) uses Title-Case tool names; pi native uses lowercase.
 * When claude-bridge is active we activate the CC-named aliases so the model
 * sees the same surface it was trained on.
